= Argentum {{title componentName}} component. API application.

API and migration binaries for the `{{projectPrefix}}_{{componentName}}` component.
The `api` binary wires the component's business, infrastructure and rest packages into an HTTP server. The `migration` binary runs the component's database migrations.

== How to run

[source,shell]
----
cargo run --bin migration
cargo run --bin api
----

== Environment variables

- `{{upper_snake projectPrefix}}_DATABASE_URL` — Postgres connection string, required by both binaries
- `{{upper_snake projectPrefix}}_LISTEN` — listen address of the `api` binary, optional, default `0.0.0.0:8088`
